    "content": "Turn your own photos into viral rap duo videos with [Photo to Rap AI Online](/) in 3 minutes.\n\nGood rap battle lines are specific, they rhyme on the last word, and they land the joke at the end of the second line. Here are 25 original, clean roast bars grouped by the kind of friend you're battling, then how to write your own and turn the battle into a video.\n\n\n\n## The late one\n\n\n> You're always late, it's a fact, not a rumor,\n\nyour watch runs on vibes and a bad sense of humor.\n\n\n> You showed up at ten for a party at eight,\n\neven your excuses are running late.\n\n\n\n## The bad cook\n\n\n> Your cooking's so bad that the smoke alarm cheers,\n\nthe only applause that you've gotten in years.\n\n\n> You burned a salad, I'm still in shock,\n\nyou'd need a recipe to boil a rock.\n\n\n\n## The gym member who never goes\n\n\n> You've got a gym membership framed on the wall,\n\nthe only thing there that got lifted at all.\n\n\n> You say you're bulking, I say you're just eating,\n\nyour only PR is the snooze you're repeating.\n\n\n\n## The gamer\n\n\n> You rage-quit so fast the controller's in therapy,\n\nyour K/D's so low it's practically charity.\n\n\n> You camp in the corner and call it a strategy,\n\nyour aim is so off it should come with an apology.\n\n\n\n## The group chat ghost\n\n\n> You leave me on read like it's part of your brand,\n\nthree days for a \"k\", I don't understand.\n\n\n> Your voice notes are podcasts, eleven minutes long,\n\nto tell me the pizza you ordered was wrong.\n\n\n\n## The fashion risk\n\n\n> You wear Crocs with socks and you call it a flex,\n\nthe fashion police got your photo on their desk.\n\n\n> Sunglasses indoors and your hat to the side,\n\nyou look like a GPS that lost its guide.\n\n\n\n## The driver\n\n\n> You drive like a GPS stuck on \"recalculate\",\n\nfour left turns just to find the front gate.\n\n\n> You parked in two spaces, and one was a lawn,\n\nthe HOA wrote you a letter at dawn.\n\n\n\n## The \"rapper\"\n\n\n> Your flow is so slow it's stuck on buffering mode,\n\nyour rhymes need a map and a ZIP code.\n\n\n> You rap like a ringtone from 2009,\n\nstuck on one beat and you're still off time.\n\n\n> You call yourself fire, but I'm feeling a chill,\n\nyour bars are so weak they need a doctor's bill.\n\n\n\n## The cheap one\n\n\n> You split the free samples, then asked me to tip,\n\nyou'd Venmo-request me for one little sip.\n\n\n\n## The selfie addict\n\n\n> Ninety-nine selfies to post just the one,\n\nyour camera's exhausted, your front flash is done.\n\n\n\n## The sleeper\n\n\n> You sleep until noon and call it \"early to rise\",\n\nyour alarm clock quit for a new job, surprise.\n\n\n\n## The sibling\n\n\n> Mom's favorite? Please, that's a story you tell,\n\nshe only says it so you'll clean up as well.\n\n\n\n## The coworker\n\n\n> You reply-all to everyone, up to the CEO,\n\nto say thanks for a meeting that ended an hour ago.\n\n\n> You're on mute every call, then you talk for a while,\n\nwe've been reading your lips, silent-movie style.\n\n\n\n## The sports fan\n\n\n> Your team hasn't won since your dad still had hair,\n\nyou still wear the jersey like somebody cares.\n\n\n\n## The dancer\n\n\n> You dance like a phone on a table, vibrating,\n\nthe DJ stopped the song and he's still hesitating.\n\n\n\n## How to write your own roast bars\n\n\n\n\n- **Pick one real detail.** The burned salad, the 3 days on read, the lawn parking. One detail your friend will recognize beats ten generic insults.\n\n- **Put the punchline last.** Set it up in the first line, land it on the last word of the second.\n\n- **Rhyme the ends.** \"Rumor / humor\", \"therapy / charity\": the rhyme is what makes it sound like a bar and not a complaint.\n\n- **Keep it a roast.** Aim at habits, not at things people can't change, and only battle people who are in on the joke.\n\n\n\n\n## Turn the battle into a video\n\n\nLines on a page are fine. The two of you actually battling is better. Add a photo of you and one of your friend in the [AI rap battle generator](/ai-rap-battle-generator), write the matchup as the topic (up to 120 characters), e.g. \"rap battle: Sam burns salads, Alex parks on lawns\", and the AI writes original bars around it and renders both of you trading them, lip-synced, in about 3 minutes. Aiming at someone else together? Make it a [diss track](/diss-track-generator) instead. For funny bars that don't roast anyone, see these [funny rap lyrics](/blog/funny-rap-lyrics).\n\n\n\n## FAQ\n\n\n**What are good rap battle lines to roast someone?** Lines with one specific, recognizable detail, a rhyme on the last word, and the joke at the end. The late friend, the bad cook and the gym member who never goes are classic targets.\n\n\n**How do you start a rap battle?** Open with your opponent's name and the charge, then stack the evidence one bar at a time and save the best line for last.\n\n\n**Are these lines clean?** Yes. All 25 are original, written for friends roasting friends, with no swearing.\n\n\n**Can AI make a rap battle video of me and my friend?** Yes. The [AI rap battle generator](/ai-rap-battle-generator) turns two photos and a topic into a video of the two of you trading bars. It writes its own original lyrics and doesn't copy any real artist's song or voice.\n\n## Create Your Own AI Rap Video Now\nWant to turn photos of you and your friends into an authentic hip-hop clip? Head over to [Photo to Rap AI Generator](/#generator) and generate your free preview today! Also check out the iconic orange studio on [Hotel Lobby AI](/hotel-lobby-ai)."
