    "content": "Turn your own photos into viral rap duo videos with [Photo to Rap AI Online](/) in 3 minutes.\n\n**Yes, Quavo and Takeoff are related: Quavo is Takeoff’s uncle, and Takeoff is his nephew.** That family tie is where their duo name comes from. As **Unc & Phew** (uncle and nephew), they released \"Hotel Lobby\" in 2022, the song whose orange-booth performance is now the Hotel Lobby AI trend.\n\n\n\n## Quick facts\n\n\n\n|  |  |\n| **Quavo** | Takeoff’s uncle, member of Migos |\n| **Takeoff** | Kirsnick Khari Ball, born June 18, 1994; Quavo’s nephew, youngest member of Migos |\n| **Duo name** | Unc & Phew (uncle and nephew) |\n| **First Unc & Phew song** | \"Hotel Lobby (Unc & Phew)\", released May 20, 2022 |\n| **Their album** | *Only Built for Infinity Links*, October 7, 2022 (Quality Control / Motown), No. 7 on the Billboard 200 |\n| **Where they’re from** | Lawrenceville, Georgia, near Atlanta, where Migos formed in 2008 |\n\n\n\n## How are Quavo and Takeoff related?\n\n\nTakeoff was Quavo’s nephew. Quavo is the older of the two, and they grew up together in Lawrenceville, Georgia, which is why they sound so natural trading lines: they had been rapping together since their teens. When they recorded as a duo, they leaned into it and named the project after the relationship itself: **Unc & Phew**.\n\n\n\n## Is Offset related to Quavo and Takeoff?\n\n\nOffset, the third member of Migos, was long described as their cousin. According to [Wikipedia’s Migos article](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Migos), Offset later said he isn’t related to either of them and was a schoolmate of Quavo. He grew up with them and was part of the group from the start, but he isn’t on \"Hotel Lobby\" or on the Unc & Phew album.\n\n\n\n## Who are Unc & Phew?\n\n\nUnc & Phew is the name Quavo and Takeoff used for their two-man project in 2022, amid rumors that Migos had split. They released:\n\n\n\n\n- **\"Hotel Lobby (Unc & Phew)\"** (May 20, 2022), the first single and the one everyone knows now.\n\n- More singles through the summer and autumn, including \"Us vs. Them\" with Gucci Mane and \"Big Stunna\" with Birdman.\n\n- The album ***Only Built for Infinity Links*** on October 7, 2022, 18 tracks, which debuted at No. 7 on the Billboard 200.\n\n\n\nThe title nods to Raekwon’s 1995 classic *Only Built 4 Cuban Linx*, and the \"infinity links\" are the unbreakable family bond between the two.\n\n\n\n## Takeoff’s death\n\n\nLess than a month after the album came out, on **November 1, 2022**, Takeoff was shot and killed in Houston, Texas. He was 28. That is part of why the \"Hotel Lobby\" performance means so much to fans: it is one of the last times the uncle and nephew performed side by side, and Quavo has shared it again as the AI trend spread.\n\n\n\n## From Unc & Phew to the Hotel Lobby AI trend\n\n\nTheir orange-booth performance of \"Hotel Lobby\" (the full story is in [the Hotel Lobby song guide](/blog/hotel-lobby-song-quavo-takeoff)) became a template in 2026: people put themselves and a friend in the same orange booth as a rap duo, with AI doing the performance. That is the whole idea of the trend, two people, one stage, the easy back-and-forth that made Unc & Phew work.\n\n\nYou can make your own version from two photos with the [Hotel Lobby AI video generator](/hotel-lobby-ai). It writes an **original** rap and beat for the two of you (it doesn’t use the real song or clone anyone’s voice), and renders your duo performing it in about 3 minutes. For the step by step, see [how to do the Hotel Lobby trend](/blog/how-to-do-the-hotel-lobby-trend).\n\n\nLooking for more great pairs? See the [best rap duos of all time](/blog/best-rap-duos).\n\n\n[Photo to Rap AI](/) isn’t affiliated with Quavo, Takeoff, Migos, Quality Control or COLORS.\n\n\n\n## FAQ\n\n\n**Is Quavo Takeoff’s uncle or cousin?** Uncle. Takeoff was Quavo’s nephew, which is what \"Unc & Phew\" means.\n\n\n**Are Quavo and Offset related?** Offset has said he isn’t related to Quavo or Takeoff; he was Quavo’s schoolmate and grew up with them.\n\n\n**What does Unc & Phew mean?** \"Unc\" is uncle (Quavo) and \"Phew\" is nephew (Takeoff). It is the name of their 2022 duo project.\n\n\n**What album is Hotel Lobby on?** *Only Built for Infinity Links* (2022), the Unc & Phew album by Quavo and Takeoff.\n\n\n**How old was Takeoff?** He was born on June 18, 1994, and died on November 1, 2022, at 28.\n\n\nSources: [Only Built for Infinity Links (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Only_Built_for_Infinity_Links), [Takeoff (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Takeoff_(rapper)), [Migos (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Migos), [BET](https://www.bet.com/article/plfoaz/quavo-takeoff-unc-phew-collaborative-project).\n\n## Create Your Own AI Rap Video Now\nWant to turn photos of you and your friends into an authentic hip-hop clip? Head over to [Photo to Rap AI Generator](/#generator) and generate your free preview today! Also check out the iconic orange studio on [Hotel Lobby AI](/hotel-lobby-ai)."
